  "details": "Being able to sort our prints into collections would be incredibly helpful for quickly finding them to share. Alternatively, I'd suggest the option to simply rearrange the order of the prints but favorites lists feels like the natural course of things since they exist for avatars, worlds, and friends. \n\nMy collection of prints consist of memes, photos taken from fun moments in-game, and maps for Terrors of Nowhere that I like to drop in-world for others or myself to reference on the spot. They are unfortunately all mixed together so it takes a bit sifting through the mess to find what I'm looking for to match the occasion quickly and get back to the moment/game.",
